<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Robe, ring, sandals on</l><l>And my hunger’s gone!</l><l>Back where I belong , again!</l><l>(Because He) Clothed me thoroughly,</l><l>(And then He) Reinstated me!</l><l>(Now I’m) Back in the family again!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
